  "steps": [
    "Heat oil in a pan. Add garlic, onion, cashews, tomatoes, salt, water. Cook for 10 mins.",
    "For the filling add crumbled paneer, chopped spinach, salt, chilli flakes, black pepper & mix well.",
    "Stuff button mushrooms with the filling.",
    "Cool down the tomato curry, add soy milk, and blend everything together.",
    "Heat the blended mixture again, add stuffed mushrooms, cheese & oregano.",
    "Serve hot with boiled quinoa."
  ],
